# save: 03-GiantStep
# Sweep segment 03 -> 04: Hotel Onett out the side door, north through Onett past the library
# to the touring entertainers' shack (Key to the shack: "The door opened"), through the shack
# to the cave behind it (lower level, rope, middle level, rope, top level; Rowdy Mice and
# Attack Slugs on Auto Fight, 2 overworld Lifeups), out onto the Giant Step ledge, the side
# cave, the dungeon rooms and ropes to Titanic Ant (PSI Rockin alpha, Pizza, Hamburger, Bash),
# the footprint melody, back down the same way to the cave behind the shack (the cop at the
# exit: "Get yer butt to the Onett Police Station", Yes), through the shack and back to the
# hotel phone: Dad, Record, Continue (04-Police starts there; its L13 came from levelling).
# Recorded in chunks with playtest/sweep/rec.py
# The hotel side door: the original's CPU-time frame (hotel-door.play)
# late-pads: the port replays the pads the original read after each lag-merged frame
# Each door: skip K (the first emu sample is part-way into the load), lag K+20 (its fade-in
# starts a CPU-time frame later), ignore: idle K+30 (that FADE_IN after the load lag ends a
# logic frame later in the original; wall-clock noise). The other idle masks are the same
# fade-in end after a battle
